athcal A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathcal B\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(A\\cap B\\neq\\varnothing)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}mesh\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2MeshRelation}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathcal B\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(A\\cap B\\neq\\varnothing)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Two nonempty families mesh exactly when every cross-pair intersects; the nonemptiness clauses prevent vacuous meshing.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-relation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2MeshRelation}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}mesh\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2MeshRelation}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal A\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathcal B\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(A\\cap B\\neq\\varnothing)","display":true}],"bytes":925,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1897","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-